contigo, Sr. Tanuki!

150
00:11:46,100 --> 00:11:48,190
Sr. Tanuki... Obrigado!

151
00:11:48,190 --> 00:11:51,520
Tu és mesmo especial,
pequeno tanuki.

152
00:11:51,860 --> 00:12:01,450
